14. RESTORE CONTEXT
One of the most important consequences of persistent intelligence is context restoration.
A new AI conversation does not inherently possess the complete history of a person's projects, decisions, goals, or lessons.
A Superbrain can provide a mechanism through which the relevant context can be reconstructed.
Therefore:
The AI model can change without the human having to lose the continuity of the relationship.
This creates an important separation:
AI MODEL
The intelligence engine.
NAYA POWER
The human's persistent intelligence layer.
That distinction is fundamental to model independence.

15. AI AGNOSTICISM
