If one model becomes better at reasoning, another at coding, another at research, and another at multimodal generation, the human should ideally be able to use them without rebuilding their entire operating environment.
The intelligence layer remains.
The models become interchangeable capabilities underneath it.
This creates the possibility of:
One persistent human intelligence environment operating across many AI systems.

